liant Corners</a></i><br />(1988)\n</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><i><b>Gotstabe a Better Way!</b></i> is an album by saxophonist <a href=\"/wiki/James_Spaulding\" title=\"James Spaulding\">James Spaulding</a> which was recorded in 1988 and released on the <a href=\"/wiki/Muse_Records\" title=\"Muse Records\">Muse</a> label.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Reception\">Reception</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Gotstabe_a_Better_Way!&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Reception\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable floatright\" style=\"width:24.2em;font-size:88%;text-align:center;margin:0.5em 0 0.5em 1em;padding:0;border-spacing:0\"><caption style=\"font-size:115%\">Professional ratings</caption><tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#202122;background:#d1dbdf;font-size:100%\">Review scores</th></tr><tr><th scope=\"col\">Source</th><th scope=\"col\">Rating</th></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><a href=\"/wiki/AllMusic\" title=\"AllMusic\">AllMusic</a></td><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\" title=\"4.5/5 stars\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"4.5/5 stars\"><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Half star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Star_half.svg/20px-Star_half.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Star_half.svg/40px-Star_half.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span></span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Allmusic&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Allmusic-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/AllMusic\" title=\"AllMusic\">AllMusic</a> review by Michael G. Nastos stated \"Veteran saxophonist in his best light\".<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Allmusic&#95;4-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Allmusic-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Track_listing\">Track listing</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Gotstabe_a_Better_Way!&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Track listing\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>All compositions by James Spaulding except where noted\n</p>\n<ol><li>\"Bold Steps\" – 5:39</li>\n<li>\"Blue Hue\" – 5:14</li>\n<li>\"Ginger Flower Song\" – 6:10</li>\n<li>\"Remember There's Hope\" – 5:55</li>\n<li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/Little_Niles_(song)\" title=\"Little Niles (song)\">Little Niles</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Randy_Weston\" title=\"Randy Weston\">Randy Weston</a>) – 6:32</li>\n<li>\"Gotstabe\" – 6:28</li>\n<li>\"In Flight Out\" – 6:40</li>\n<li>\"I Have You\" – 5:35</li>\n<li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/Barbados_(composition)\" title=\"Barbados (composition)\">Barbados</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Charlie_Parker\" title=\"Charlie Parker\">Charlie Parker</a>) – 6:21</li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Personnel\">Personnel</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Gotstabe_a_Better_Way!&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Personnel\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/James_Spaulding\" title=\"James Spaulding\">James Spaulding</a> – <a href=\"/wiki/Alto_saxophone\" title=\"Alto saxophone\">alto saxophone</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Flute\" title=\"Flute\">flute</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Piccolo\" title=\"Piccolo\">piccolo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mulgrew_Miller\" title=\"Mulgrew Miller\">Mulgrew Miller</a> – <a href=\"/wiki/Piano\" title=\"Piano\">piano</a></li>\n<li>Monte Croft – <a href=\"/wiki/Vibraphone\" title=\"Vibraphone\">vibraphone</a> (tracks 2–4 &amp; 6–9)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ron_Carter\" title=\"Ron Carter\">Ron Carter</a> – <a href=\"/wiki/Double_bass\" title=\"Double bass\">bass</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ralph_Peterson_Jr.\" title=\"Ralph Peterson Jr.\">Ralph Peterson Jr.</a> – <a href=\"/wiki/Drum_kit\" title=\"Drum kit\">drums</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ray_Mantilla\" title=\"Ray Mantilla\">Ray Mantilla</a> – <a href=\"/wiki/Congas\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Congas\">congas</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Percussion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Percussion\">percussion</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"References\">References</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Gotstabe_a_Better_Way!&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit se